{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05578","headline":"淮南寄舍弟 · 王泠然","name":"淮南寄舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔予从不调，经岁旅淮源。\n念尔长相失，何时返故园。\n寄书迷处所，分袂隔凉温。\n远道俱爲客，他乡共在原。\n归情春伴雁，愁泣夜随猨。\n愧见高堂上，朝朝独倚门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王泠然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}